{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whelm is about a young penguin, washed up on a mysterious island. Once a thriving sanctuary, it has fallen into disrepair. You must rescue animals, nurture plants and repair machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No missions or levelling up. This is a game about <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>experimentation</strong>. Go at your own pace. Use the monocular to scan the terrain or just pick a direction and go.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see an animal out of place or in distress, don't just stand there. Figure out what they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean the Beaches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Junk can be found scattered around the beaches. Gather up any garbage you see and put it where it belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power the Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find machines around the island, but it's been a long time since they were serviced. For supplies, try the vending machines. If the machine still doesn't work, try shouting at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not all work. Take your time and mess around. There are no adults here to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready, find a way to reach the next island. Unfortunately the young penguin is not a strong swimmer, so you'll have to get creative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <br>Language Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  menu, controls and settings are English only at this time. Gameplay does not include any dialogue or text. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2906320?t=1761631113","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/f103cb7f9021366238dfeccc69f28f775f16ff1d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761631113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/d4fe0d05230f3731d451117472290d978eab145c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761631113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/d4fe0d05230f3731d451117472290d978eab145c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761631113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD Whelm TO YOUR WISHLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/extras/fd9d79de31ccb1b2139737b35971d2bc.avif?t=1761631113\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whelm is about a young penguin, washed up on a mysterious island. Once a thriving sanctuary, it has fallen into disrepair. You must rescue animals, nurture plants and repair machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No missions or levelling up. This is a game about <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>experimentation</strong>. Go at your own pace. Use the monocular to scan the terrain or just pick a direction and go.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see an animal out of place or in distress, don't just stand there. Figure out what they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean the Beaches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Junk can be found scattered around the beaches. Gather up any garbage you see and put it where it belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power the Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find machines around the island, but it's been a long time since they were serviced. For supplies, try the vending machines. If the machine still doesn't work, try shouting at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not all work. Take your time and mess around. There are no adults here to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready, find a way to reach the next island. Unfortunately the young penguin is not a strong swimmer, so you'll have to get creative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <br>Language Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The  menu, controls and settings are English only at this time. Gameplay does not include any dialogue or text. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Lesser Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906320/948adf365e60ae59f15bb858d82eaec1b349c5bd/header.jpg?t=1761631113","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2906320/102164579/f669102928f2543766a6a8f5657abc34a058f52a/1761505147/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761548597","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2906320/102164579/f669102928f2543766a6a8f5657abc34a058f52a/1761505147/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761548597","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2906320/102164579/f669102928f2543766a6a8f5657abc34a058f52a/1761505147/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761548597","id":257222767,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222767/movie480.mp4?t=1761548597","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257222767/movie_max.mp4?t=1761